NOTICE OF MODIFICATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a FORK of facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk, taken at
commit 86cf33f ("tests: stub MUSE_LINK_REQ_TOO_LARGE in the voice note
harness"), and is distributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE).

Upstream has commits after that one; this fork is deliberately left on 86cf33f
because that is the revision the port was built and verified against. To move
forward, rebase this fork's single commit onto the desired upstream commit --
nothing outside the files listed below is touched, so conflicts, if any, are
confined to those files.

The fork adds one port to the ESP32 SDK: a Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-3.49 V2
board plus a Chinese voice backend that does not use a Meta account or SDK
token. The upstream project, its name, its logo and its documentation
describing Meta's own service are unchanged and remain Meta's.

Modifications, per the Apache License, Version 2.0, section 4(b):

  NEW FILES (no upstream counterpart)

    esp32/components/muse/boards/board_waveshare_s3_lcd_349.c
        Board file: panel, transposed touch controller, both codecs, battery,
        backlight, landscape frame rotation.

    esp32/components/muse/muse_chat_cn.c
        MUSE_CN_VOICE backend: iFlytek ASR, SenseNova LLM, iFlytek TTS,
        caption paging.

    esp32/devices/sdkconfig.waveshare-s3-lcd-349
        Board profile, with the credential fields deliberately left empty.

    README.waveshare-s3-lcd-349.md
    NOTICE
    host-tools/                                   (host-side test scripts)

  MODIFIED FILES

    README.md
        A fork banner added at the top. The rest of the file is upstream's.

    esp32/.gitignore
        Ignores the local credential overlay.

    esp32/components/muse/CMakeLists.txt
        Builds muse_chat_cn.c under MUSE_CN_VOICE; registers the new board
        file; adds esp_websocket_client and esp_netif to the private requires.

    esp32/components/muse/Kconfig
        New MUSE_BOARD_WAVESHARE_S3_LCD_349 choice, new MUSE_CN_VOICE backend
        and its iFlytek/SenseNova settings, and MUSE_HATCH made exclusive of it.

    esp32/components/muse/idf_component.yml
        Adds espressif/esp_websocket_client, and lets the new board id use
        esp_lcd_axs15231b.

    esp32/components/muse/muse_input.c / .h
        muse_input_post_ptt(): lets a touch widget post the same PTT events the
        BOOT button does.

    esp32/components/muse/muse_ui.c
        On-screen push-to-record button; reports the real caption page size to
        the state layer so long replies can be paged.

    esp32/components/muse/muse_voice.c
        Captions for the touch button's press/release model.

    esp32/main/app.c
        Registers a Wi-Fi override network with the link keeper after it
        connects, so the association survives past DHCP.

    esp32/tools/board.sh
        Registers waveshare-s3-lcd-349, loads the Muse UI profile before the
        board overlay, and loads the git-ignored credential overlay last.

